# Shelter toadstool 0 (ticket 33.2): a toadstool big enough to shelter under, a broad round cap: 5.5 m high, its cap 8 m across, on a stout
# pale stem leaning a little. Overhead cover against the Prime-copter's cannon and the downdraft dive (the cap's underside is
# 3.9 m up, under the copter's 9 m minimum height). The stem is the collider (a capsule); the cap is a part (shelter_cap0).
# The origin is the stem's foot on the ground.
format 1
collider capsule

Detail detail=0.25
    Union
        Material material=arena_stone
            SmoothUnion smoothness=0.2
                # The stem's bulb, flat on the ground
                Intersection
                    Ellipsoid radii=(0.9, 0.6, 0.9)
                    Translate translation=(0, 0.6, 0)
                        Box size=(2, 0.6, 2)
                ArbitraryRoundCone a=(0, 0.7, 0) b=(0.15, 4.0, 0) radiusA=0.7 radiusB=0.45
        Translate translation=(0.15, 3.9, 0)
            Part part=shelter_cap0
